{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A listless struggle flits across the borders of change and desire. It brings a smell \u2014 noxious, fresh and foul. You can feel it, can\u2019t you? Something more than the wind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The phone is ringing again. The message hasn't changed:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Find out what happened to the moths.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467100/extras/6bde5fb476ad850f68b4883293a23609.avif?t=1761518491\" width=500 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chiaroscuro Imago </i>is a short, sweet, literary horror game inspired by ancient poetry, the works of David Lynch, and the occult. Trudge blearily across the nameless byway, confabulate whenever possible, and uncover what lies behind closed doors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It may be completed in one sitting; there is only one ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please play in an unlit room.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR PURCHASE INCLUDES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portents of uncertainty and dread in an unlovely world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honeyed words exchanged with an eclectic cast of slippery origin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bonus folder lined with interesting minutiae about the game\u2019s development.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An experience that will follow you to bed.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2467100?t=1761518491","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467100/012ce7230e3ad89e866940eb64c0484eb3615759/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761518491","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2467100/bf22fd30c5e00f1c8af7e4bbb94e4f8035c7000f/capsule_231x87.j